---
// About page: Story, stats, milestones
---

<section id="about-story" class="bg-white py-16 lg:py-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-[30px] lg:text-[36px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-8 text-center">
      Our Story
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center mb-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7">
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-4">
          Michelle Turpin P.C. began with a simple conviction: no one should have to face the IRS alone. With nearly 40 years of experience, Michelle has guided thousands of individuals and businesses through audits, collections, appeals, and complex settlement negotiations.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] mb-4">
          As the firm grew, so did its capabilities. We added bankruptcy law to address the many situations where tax debt and financial hardship overlap, and we welcomed attorneys with deep federal experience, including a former IRS Chief Counsel attorney who once represented the government in some of its most complex cases.
        </p>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[16px] leading-[1.65]">
          Today, with offices serving the Greater Salt Lake City area and southern Utah, our team brings more than 100 years of cumulative experience exclusively practicing tax law. We remain what we have always been: a client-first firm where experienced attorneys and professionals personally handle every matter, from the first consultation through final resolution.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <div class="relative rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden shadow-lg">
          <img
            src="/assets/media/11df912c2685f751a0763459dfdd46fc-1024.webp"
            alt="Michelle Turpin P.C. office"
            class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16 py-8 border-y border-gray-200">
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-[40px] lg:text-[48px] font-bold text-[#C1272D] font-serif leading-none">100+</p>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-[#4B5563] mt-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Years of Cumulative Experience</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-[40px] lg:text-[48px] font-bold text-[#C1272D] font-serif leading-none">2</p>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-[#4B5563] mt-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Utah Offices</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-[40px] lg:text-[48px] font-bold text-[#C1272D] font-serif leading-none">1000s</p>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-[#4B5563] mt-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Cases Resolved</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <p class="text-[40px] lg:text-[48px] font-bold text-[#C1272D] font-serif leading-none">50</p>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-[#4B5563] mt-2 uppercase tracking-wider">States Served</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Milestones Timeline -->
    <h3 class="text-[26px] lg:text-[30px] font-bold text-[#1A1A1A] font-serif mb-8 text-center">
      Milestones Along the Way
    </h3>

    <div class="space-y-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 items-start border-l-4 border-[#C1272D] pl-5 py-2">
        <span class="text-[#C1272D] font-serif font-bold text-[20px] md:w-24 shrink-0">1989</span>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          Michelle Turpin graduates from University of Utah School of Law and begins her career in tax law, later earning an LL.M. in Taxation from University of San Diego.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 items-start border-l-4 border-[#C1272D] pl-5 py-2">
        <span class="text-[#C1272D] font-serif font-bold text-[20px] md:w-24 shrink-0">1990s</span>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          The firm takes shape as Michelle builds a practice focused exclusively on tax controversy, representing taxpayers before the IRS and Utah State Tax Commission.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 items-start border-l-4 border-[#C1272D] pl-5 py-2">
        <span class="text-[#C1272D] font-serif font-bold text-[20px] md:w-24 shrink-0">2000s</span>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          The firm expands into bankruptcy law, becoming a full-service tax and bankruptcy practice capable of handling complex financial distress cases.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 items-start border-l-4 border-[#C1272D] pl-5 py-2">
        <span class="text-[#C1272D] font-serif font-bold text-[20px] md:w-24 shrink-0">2015</span>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          Richard Kennedy joins after retiring from the IRS Office of Chief Counsel, deepening the firm's federal litigation and trust-fund expertise.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 items-start border-l-4 border-[#C1272D] pl-5 py-2">
        <span class="text-[#C1272D] font-serif font-bold text-[20px] md:w-24 shrink-0">2021</span>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          A second office opens in St. George, extending the firm's reach across southern Utah and improving access for clients statewide.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-8 items-start border-l-4 border-[#C1272D] pl-5 py-2">
        <span class="text-[#C1272D] font-serif font-bold text-[20px] md:w-24 shrink-0">Today</span>
        <p class="text-[#374151] text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
          With more than 100 years of cumulative experience, the team continues to represent taxpayers nationwide before the IRS and state taxing authorities.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
